    "body": "## Problem\r\n\r\nWhen buffer is open in multiple windows and its line count changes, any `statusline` or `rulerformat` items depending on it (e.g. `%P`) will become invalid in non-current windows because `w_redr_status` is only set on first change.\r\n\r\n## Solution\r\n\r\nSet `w_redr_status` on all windows with the buffer when the line count changes.",
    "closed_at": "2026-07-22T16:05:38Z",
    "comment_data": [],
    "comment_regular_data": [
